      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1 = 1²<br />\n4 = 2²<br />\n? = 3² = 9<br />\n16 = 4²<br />\n25 = 5²</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, the missing number is 9.</p>\n",
