      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">→ 7 $ 3:</span> 7<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 3<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 49 + 9 = <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">58</span> (Matches)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 $ 2:</span> 6<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 2<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 36 + 4 = 40 </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">→ </span>5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 25 + 1 = 26.</p>\n",
