      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/04/IMG-2158_Yogesh%2879%29.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 239px;\" /></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"228\" data-start=\"210\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span data-end=\"226\" data-start=\"210\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Conclusions:</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"230\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Some Tall is Big – <span data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"252\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> True</span> (As some super are tall and all super are big. so, some tall are definitely big).</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"496\" data-start=\"358\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some Bold is Tall – <span data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"382\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">True</span> (Since some Super are Tall and all Super are Bold through Big, those Super who are Tall are also Bold.)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"601\" data-start=\"498\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">III. All Super is Bold – <span data-end=\"531\" data-start=\"523\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">True</span> (All Super are Big and all Big are Bold, hence all Super are Bold.)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"603\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">All the conclusions follow.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"653\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"653\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">The correct answer is Option 4.</span></p>\n",
