      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">25 - 3 ÷ 5 +10 = ? ⇒ 25 <span style=\"text-align: center;\">×</span> 3 + 5 - 10 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">25 <span style=\"text-align: center;\">×</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> 3</span></u> + 5 - 10 = ? ⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">75</span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> + 5</span></u> - 10 = ? ⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">80</span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> - 10</span></u> = ? ⇒ 70 = ?</p>\n",
